  id: Snow_Cabin_4
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 4"
  content: "\tWho ever said heaven was above? I have lived up here all my life, and
    I will tell you: there is nothing up here but cold and emptiness that will swallow
    your breath without ceremony.\n\r\n\tHeaven is the brown soil below. Down there.
    Always was."
